                <pb facs="0262" n="154" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg154"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Young.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-10"><hi rendition="#italic">November 10,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegram received. You will protest without delay, as instructed 7th, and demand
                    disavowal and apology, whether President authorized firing or not.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
